phan;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><font face=\"宋体\"></font></span></p></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"></font></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);\nletter-spacing:0.0000pt;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;\nfont-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);\nmso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);\"><font face=\"宋体\"></font></span></p></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"宋体\" style=\"\"></font></span></p><span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);\nletter-spacing:0.0000pt;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;\nfont-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);\nmso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);\"><font face=\"宋体\"></font></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><font face=\"宋体\"></font></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">更新时间：2021.4.22</span></span></span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;text-indent:0.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">此攻略主要帮助萌新了解天子大致强度。从PVP、Raid、WB三个角度评价。<br>说明：<br>①任何攻略都是主观的，在天子的强度上一定会有分歧，也会有误判；<br>②<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">评价为不点火的强度，点火后的强度详情可参考点火推荐。</span><br>③在WB、Raid中，不点火是TS四连刀的天下，点火后是SS六连刀的天下（WB中再加上亚里亚）。点火后的SS六连对于其他刀的压制是绝对的。SS六连刀在WB、Raid、PVP都是压倒性的强大，甚至可以说其余刀都没什么练的必要。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">此帖是对未点火的评价，对于刀卡的评价实际上没有意义也没有必要；但刀卡以外天子的评价受点火影响较小。</span><br>④评价会考虑未来的天子，如果策划削弱某些天子，主观上不承担责任；<br>⑤WB中，主刀指吃到大量buff的刀，目前为攻击力排前二的刀（一攻及二攻刀），鲁邦实装后主刀变为前三攻。其余刀为副刀；<br>⑥可以用作点火/还魂的天子建议参考此贴；<br>⑦<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">打*号意思是，该天子只能在属性克制场合下登场，如光双刃只能在暗WB、暗Raid登场且达到S的强度。</span><br></span></span></span><br></p></span></span></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span></p></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0.0000pt;margin-right:0.0000pt;margin-bottom:0.0000pt;\nmargin-left:0.0000pt;padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\ntext-align:left;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(51,51,51);\nletter-spacing:0.0000pt;text-transform:none;font-style:normal;\nfont-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;background:rgb(255,255,255);\nmso-shading:rgb(255,255,255);\"></span><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\nmso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; font-style: normal; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1616987506883_51791022.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1616987506883_51791022.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1616987506890_78361565.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1616987506890_78361565.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1616987506891_58224509.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1616987506891_58224509.png\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img